size(400);
import TrigMacros;

rr_cartesian_axes(-10,10,-10,10,complexplane=false, usegrid = true);



draw(circle((4,4), 4*1.41421356237));
draw(circle((4,-4), 4*1.41421356237));
draw(circle((-4,4), 4*1.41421356237));
draw(circle((-4,-4), 4*1.41421356237));


</asy>
The way we figure out the area is by splitting it the following way:
