<cmath>\frac{a}{b}\cdot\pi-\sqrt{c}+d,</cmath>
where <math>a,b,c,</math> and <math>d</math> are positive integers and <math>a</math> and <math>b</math> are relatively prime. What is <math>a+b+c+d</math>?

