==Solution 1 (Cheese, draw the path)==
For this question, I cheesed it by just drawing the path with a ruler and an compass, and you can find that the path eventually terminates at vertex B by doing so. Therefore, the answer is <imath>\boxed{\mathbf{(B)\,\mathnormal{B}}}</imath>.

