<cmath>\sqrt{3} = \overline{AE} = x + y</cmath>
<cmath>\overline{AM} = \sqrt{(2\sqrt{3})^2 + 1^2} = \sqrt{13}</cmath>
<cmath>\overline{CD} = \sqrt{y^2 + 3^2} = \sqrt{y^2 + 9} = \sqrt{x^2 - 2\sqrt{3}x + 12}</cmath>
<cmath>\overline{DM} = \sqrt{x^2 + 1^2 - 2 \cdot 1 \cdot x \cdot \cos{30^\circ} } = \sqrt{x^2 - \sqrt{3}x + 1}</cmath>
<cmath>\overline{CD} + \overline{DM} = \overline{AM}</cmath>
<cmath>\sqrt{x^2 - 2\sqrt{3}x + 12} + \sqrt{x^2 - \sqrt{3}x + 1} = \sqrt{13}</cmath>
